      "en": "I am like a pelican of the wilderness. I have become as an owl of the waste places.",
      "ko": "나는 광야의 당아새 같고 황폐한 곳의 부엉이 같이 되었사오며",
      "source_text_hash": "139328cd8b932802d663fbb9209cb6ede354401845f65d97e387da13dac0f418",
      "translation_text_hash": "c53497dca30b6d10eff112fdfffc117b2d91ab652e5f197edf04fa6060c61889",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
