        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 102,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "For I have eaten ashes like bread, and mixed my drink with tears,",
      "ko": "나는 재를 양식 같이 먹으며 나의 마심에는 눈물을 섞었사오니",
      "source_text_hash": "f41dfc1a89cc0b6dd82194f75ce18b6f63ea25f1e8dab7ba443ab46cf67034fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "a0213edc7c69151ec031aae8ff56e91144e5d4a5825adb621377b4a629282c48",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
